Comment: 0,0:00:00.55,0:00:00.58,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Opening}
Comment: 0,0:01:26.36,0:01:26.39,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Episode}
Comment: 0,0:00:00.55,0:00:00.58,Default,OP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 50,0:01:34.80,0:01:35.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is awesome!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:37.40,0:01:38.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guys, check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.23,0:01:40.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haha!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:40.52,0:01:41.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm like Sanji!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:41.72,0:01:43.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened to your head?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:43.20,0:01:46.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It used to be so big and tall, like\Nyou had a giant light bulb growing
Dialogue: 50,0:01:46.40,0:01:47.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,out of your skull.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:47.46,0:01:48.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My head?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:49.26,0:01:50.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:50.27,0:01:54.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, it had grown quite\Nlong you see, so I cut it.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:54.22,0:01:56.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What, like you had it snipped\Noff at the frikken barber?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:56.78,0:01:57.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then I had to.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:58.03,0:01:59.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What else was I to do?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:59.61,0:02:01.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When I last saw you,\Nit was so big.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:01.82,0:02:03.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was almost as tall as a giant!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:03.87,0:02:06.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard it was big,\Nbut that sounds ridiculous.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.70,0:02:07.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was like a balloon.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:10.18,0:02:12.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You cut your head\Nbut you're still alive?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:12.68,0:02:14.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How is that even possible?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:15.97,0:02:20.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, you see, my young friends,\NI have a brain.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.81,0:02:23.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I bit my tongue.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:23.13,0:02:23.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:23.94,0:02:24.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My poor tongue.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.88,0:02:26.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Old man, you okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:28.74,0:02:33.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You see, my young friends,\NI've eaten the brain fruit.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.72,0:02:36.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It allows me to absorb\Nlimitless knowledge.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:36.64,0:02:41.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But the more my brain knows,\Nthe more it grows and grows and grows.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:41.54,0:02:46.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On top of my natural genius,\NI possess an unlimited data bank.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.23,0:02:48.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thus, I have the world's\Nlargest brain.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:48.87,0:02:51.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And it grows larger\Nand larger every day.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.78,0:02:52.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.80,0:02:54.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then where is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:54.24,0:02:55.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That sounds insane.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:55.57,0:02:56.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You lost me.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.65,0:03:00.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:00.45,0:03:02.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You cut your brain out\Nso now you're stupid.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.44,0:03:04.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do not trifle\Nwith a genius, boy!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:05.42,0:03:09.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This apple here is an antenna.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.46,0:03:10.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Connected to what?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.02,0:03:12.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look at the structure\Nup there.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.89,0:03:19.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The inside of that egg doesn't\Nsay Punk Records just for fun.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:19.62,0:03:22.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That is where my enormous\Nbrain is stored.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:23.88,0:03:25.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's really that big?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.45,0:03:28.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even when I'm far away,\NI remain connected to it.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.45,0:03:31.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the brain waves received\Nthrough this apple antenna.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:31.38,0:03:32.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's so cool!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.40,0:03:36.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So are you a doctor\Nof medicine too, Vegapunk?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:36.39,0:03:38.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bet, little buddy.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:39.82,0:03:44.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You met a girl when you came here,\Nwho also called herself Vegapunk, yes?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:45.50,0:03:46.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:46.09,0:03:47.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(1735,0,1,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}Yeah, she punched me in the face.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:48.94,0:03:50.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That girl is one of my clones.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:50.87,0:03:52.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There are six on the island.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.64,0:03:53.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Two ninjas?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.18,0:03:56.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Shadow Clone Jutsu!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.27,0:04:03.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Each of them has a unique talent\Nand plays a necessary role.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:03.53,0:04:06.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shaka is calm\Nand conscientious.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:09.43,0:04:12.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lilith has no morals\Nand is willing to plunder.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.50,0:04:17.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Edison is bursting with ideas.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.54,0:04:23.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The wise Pythagoras\Nfollows the path of reason.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.92,0:04:29.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Atlas is here when\Nviolence is the answer.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:32.85,0:04:35.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And the greedy York\Neats poops and sleeps.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.21,0:04:43.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They are me, in the sense that\Nthey comprise my personality.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.48,0:04:46.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But they do six\Ntimes the work.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:48.16,0:04:49.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm confused.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.39,0:04:54.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once daily, they synchronize their experiences\Nand newly acquired knowledge
Dialogue: 50,0:04:54.31,0:04:56.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,by accessing Punk Records.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:56.26,0:05:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Their personalities and missions are\Ndifferent, making each of them unique.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:00.00,0:05:02.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They are uniquely\Nuseful for my research.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.47,0:05:05.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All of you share\Nthe same brain?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.47,0:05:07.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is far beyond\Nmy comprehension.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:08.04,0:05:10.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just think of it as us\Nvisiting the same library.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:14.99,0:05:16.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me give you an example.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.23,0:05:22.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Imagine if the rest of the world accessed\Nthe database and read the information
Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.98,0:05:24.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,contained in my brain.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.71,0:05:29.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It would be as if all mankind\Nhad acquired my knowledge.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.77,0:05:30.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.50,0:05:37.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then what if those people updated Punk\NRecords with their personal discoveries,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.55,0:05:38.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,just as I do?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:41.06,0:05:45.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why, we could create a sea\Nof knowledge, far exceeding my own.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.39,0:05:48.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A library of the human\Nexperience.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.05,0:05:52.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like a super brain,\Nshared by all humanity.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.00,0:05:55.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Does that mean I could study\Nmedicine from all over the world?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.93,0:05:57.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the idea.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.85,0:06:02.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have no idea\Nwhat's going on!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.18,0:06:09.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But what happens when different\Nideologies enter the brain?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.20,0:06:10.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Won't that cause issues?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:10.54,0:06:13.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A fine question,\Nfirst son of the sea.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:13.23,0:06:18.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And yet, if we never dare to take a chance,\Nthen science will never advance.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.59,0:06:22.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course you\Nwould think that way.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:23.03,0:06:24.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.51,0:06:27.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll sacrifice anything\Nfor your research!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.08,0:06:28.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or anyone, even!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:28.56,0:06:29.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:31.38,0:06:32.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like my father.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.57,0:06:35.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You turned him into\Na heartless machine!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.81,0:06:39.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop, Bonney!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.15,0:06:41.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That beam saber is\Na failed invention!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.77,0:06:42.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:42.58,0:06:44.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It'll kill you just fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:44.66,0:06:46.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please calm down, Bonney.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.21,0:06:47.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must think this through.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:47.76,0:06:49.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know that you're angry.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.19,0:06:52.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But killing him will make\Nfar too many enemies.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:52.16,0:06:53.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:52.42,0:06:53.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[yelps]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:53.79,0:06:56.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, you're gonna\Nturn my father back.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:56.46,0:06:59.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or I swear, I'm gonna slice\Nyour head off, right here!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.77,0:07:00.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And now!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.88,0:07:02.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.92,0:07:04.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please turn off\Nthe switch, quickly!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.69,0:07:11.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's fun.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.48,0:07:14.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But it attracts\Na swarm of bugs!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:26.30,0:07:27.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bonney!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.94,0:07:29.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bonney!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.41,0:07:31.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bonney!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:31.14,0:07:31.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.46,0:07:35.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Check this out!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.40,0:07:36.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Put that down!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:36.28,0:07:37.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She'll freak out!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.56,0:07:39.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happens if\Nshe dies of shock?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.92,0:07:44.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If that weapon wasn't a failure,\NI would likely be dead.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:44.68,0:07:46.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But it's no wonder.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:46.38,0:07:47.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can blame her.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:47.94,0:07:50.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's only natural that\Nshe'd want to kill me.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.49,0:07:53.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, there was something\NI wanted to ask.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.90,0:07:56.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard you came here\Nfrom the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:56.22,0:07:56.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:58.22,0:08:00.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I also heard there were\Ntwo dragons there.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:00.87,0:08:03.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido and someone else.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.11,0:08:03.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.31,0:08:05.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's my friend Momo.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.90,0:08:08.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.04,0:08:12.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.00,0:08:13.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[VEGAPUNK] It seems he ate a failed\Nsynthetic devil fruit I left at Punk Hazard.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.51,0:08:14.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's cool.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.81,0:08:15.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.65,0:08:17.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How did it fail?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.65,0:08:19.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It wasn't from lack of effort.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.45,0:08:21.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I developed that\Nproject myself.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.88,0:08:25.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Twenty years of hard work and a whole\Nmountain of research money.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.84,0:08:28.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I tried to make a fruit from\NKaido's Bloodline Elements.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.07,0:08:32.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But in the end, I couldn't get\Nthe composition quite right.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:32.78,0:08:37.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, so that's why he was\Nable to transform like Kaido.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.14,0:08:38.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It wasn't a failure.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.48,0:08:40.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He breathes fire\Nand he's real strong.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:40.73,0:08:42.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He protects the land\Nof Wano now.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.05,0:08:45.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You did a really\Ngood job, Appleguy.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.56,0:08:47.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is the dragon's color?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.42,0:08:48.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pink-white.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:50.10,0:08:50.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Failure!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:51.77,0:08:53.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An utter failure!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:54.10,0:08:55.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with him?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.36,0:08:57.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's a genius.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.60,0:08:59.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But he's also quite\Nthe perfectionist.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:59.62,0:09:01.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:06.52,0:09:07.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, old man!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.77,0:09:09.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can you get this to move?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:09.32,0:09:11.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the one who\Nmade it, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:13.26,0:09:14.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I didn't make it.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.07,0:09:19.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the legendary iron giant that\Nis said to have attacked Mary Geoise.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.22,0:09:22.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,200 years ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.89,0:09:22.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.79,0:09:24.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And attacked Mary Geoise?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:24.50,0:09:25.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's insane!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.47,0:09:26.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[VEGAPUNK] Indubitably!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.06,0:09:30.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This monstrosity was built...\N900 years ago!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:30.92,0:09:32.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, what? Nine hundred?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.18,0:09:33.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Forgive my skepticism.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:33.47,0:09:34.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But how can that be?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:35.04,0:09:35.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Wow!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:35.60,0:09:37.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're really special, big guy!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.33,0:09:40.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So how did you\Nattack Mary Geoise?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.08,0:09:40.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cannons?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.82,0:09:41.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lasers?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:42.05,0:09:43.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.09,0:09:44.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wake up, Robonosuke!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:44.61,0:09:45.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do robot stuff!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.12,0:09:47.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get up, boy!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.37,0:09:48.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shoot lasers!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.21,0:09:48.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.02,0:09:51.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That is an antique,\Nyou troglodyte!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.66,0:09:54.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quite the fascinating story.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.59,0:09:57.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But tell me, why would the iron\Ngiant attack Mary Geoise?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.50,0:09:58.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[VEGAPUNK] A fine question!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:58.44,0:10:00.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:01.86,0:10:03.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I haven't the faintest clue.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.89,0:10:04.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER] Oh.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:26.18,0:10:28.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WORLD NOBLES yelling]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:28.19,0:10:31.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[VEGAPUNK] I heard that it ran out of power,\Nand no damage was done.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.97,0:10:40.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Regardless, I imagine its very existence\Nwas shocking to the scientists of the time.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:40.40,0:10:42.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's extraordinary... beyond.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:42.39,0:10:45.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beyond any\Ntechnology in its era.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.99,0:10:49.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[JINBE] Hmm. Hundreds of years later,\NI'd say this is still quite the shock!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:49.41,0:10:50.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We were trying\Nto wake it up, but.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:50.89,0:10:53.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It might be better\Nif it stays like this.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:52.87,0:10:54.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.83,0:10:56.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[VEGAPUNK]\NIt could be dangerous.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:56.35,0:10:59.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No one knows where this iron\Ngiant came from, after all.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.69,0:11:03.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's unclear what it was trying to do,\Nor what it was capable of.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.25,0:11:08.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As for the World Government,\Npredictably, they ordered its destruction.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.81,0:11:11.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But the scientists\Nof that age protected it.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.97,0:11:14.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They hid it away,\Nwhere no one could find it.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.95,0:11:17.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And to this day,\Nno one knows it is here.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.32,0:11:20.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not even\Nthe Government itself.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.07,0:11:24.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.76,0:11:25.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ugh.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:25.45,0:11:27.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:25.64,0:11:27.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm surprised you\Nmade it to this junk yard.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.79,0:11:30.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The entrance to here\Nlooks like a normal wall.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.51,0:11:32.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine how\Nyou found your way in.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.09,0:11:36.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:37.84,0:11:38.86,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.23,0:11:40.07,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER] He just...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.85,0:11:41.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vanished!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:42.50,0:11:43.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got turned old.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:43.87,0:11:45.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My brain wasn't workin' right.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.51,0:11:48.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We were lost and hiding!\NAnd we looked terrible!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:48.66,0:11:49.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fair.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:49.25,0:11:50.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[VEGAPUNK]\NThat sounds concerning.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:50.98,0:11:52.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NTwo hundred years ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:52.38,0:11:55.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the year fishmen were\Ngranted citizens' rights.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:55.10,0:11:57.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know how\Nthe robot works,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.34,0:12:00.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you saying it climbed\Nall the way up the Red Line?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.37,0:12:01.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHAKA] So it seems.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.68,0:12:02.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Am I crazy?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.79,0:12:06.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or does that thing look an awful lot\Nlike the robot that brought us here?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.23,0:12:07.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHAKA] That's right.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:07.18,0:12:08.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's no coincidence.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.56,0:12:11.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vegaforce-01 was\Nmodeled after the iron giant.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.75,0:12:15.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHAKA] But even with all my knowledge,\Nthere was one thing I couldn't replicate.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.63,0:12:18.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But you're the brainiest\Nbro on the entire planet!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:18.11,0:12:20.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell does it\Ntake to stump you?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.69,0:12:21.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHAKA] The power source.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.97,0:12:26.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHAKA] The way the iron giant used energy\Ndefies our modern understanding of science.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.29,0:12:32.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By the way, I'm glad Luffy\Nand the others are all right,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.63,0:12:33.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but who's that woman?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.99,0:12:35.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NUh... That's Jewelry Bonney.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.42,0:12:36.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's a pirate.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.44,0:12:37.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait a second,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.62,0:12:40.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's not the same little\Ngirl we saved earlier, is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.51,0:12:41.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.51,0:12:44.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, what is going\Non with Vegapunk's head?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.79,0:12:46.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is Bonney okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.02,0:12:47.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What gives?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:48.47,0:12:49.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[VEGAPUNK] Poor Bonney.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:49.88,0:12:51.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's been through so much.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:51.85,0:12:53.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, cause of you!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.15,0:12:54.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She should get to hit you!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:54.23,0:12:56.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you\Nknow about this, huh?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:56.81,0:12:57.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not a thing!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:59.94,0:13:04.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[VEGAPUNK] When she wakes up, there's\Nsomething important I need to give her.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:05.23,0:13:07.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But first, I have\Na favor to ask.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.07,0:13:08.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.77,0:13:11.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's extremely fortunate that you\Nshowed up here when you did.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:11.86,0:13:13.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You might even call it fate.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:13.80,0:13:15.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:15.13,0:13:17.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My dear boy, I need you to take me\Naway from Egghead.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.79,0:13:19.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I re-quasar your help!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.90,0:13:20.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.64,0:13:32.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is Cipher Pol speaking.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.23,0:13:34.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Grant us entry\Nto the island at once.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:35.09,0:13:36.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Do you copy?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:36.48,0:13:37.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I said, this is Cipher Pol...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.29,0:13:38.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[PYTHAGORAS] Oh, no, no.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.32,0:13:39.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}This is bad.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:39.11,0:13:40.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is very bad!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:41.05,0:13:41.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:53.32,0:13:55.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Should have trained\Ntheir pets better.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:58.24,0:13:59.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We received a report.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:59.04,0:14:00.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HATTORI caws]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:59.87,0:14:02.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It seems that Jewelry\NBonney is here on Egghead.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:02.33,0:14:03.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, that's convenient.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.92,0:14:05.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let her escape again.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:05.58,0:14:07.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HATTORI caws]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.08,0:14:09.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUCCI]\NShe's outlived her usefulness.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:09.36,0:14:11.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Be sure to kill her on sight.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:12.52,0:14:15.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PYTHAGORAS] Shaka, a-a Government\Nship just arrived!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:17.70,0:14:18.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:18.23,0:14:18.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.06,0:14:20.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PYTHAGORAS]\NYou pirates need to hide!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.57,0:14:23.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If the government finds out\Nyou're here, we're all doomed!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.58,0:14:25.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No complaints from us.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:25.19,0:14:28.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're not lookin' to pick a fight\Nwith them, just to be clear.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:28.29,0:14:29.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PYTHAGORAS]\NAs you shouldn't!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:29.53,0:14:31.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They have CP0 with them.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:31.40,0:14:33.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even Rob Lucci is on board!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:33.44,0:14:34.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[STRAW HATS gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:34.26,0:14:34.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:34.59,0:14:35.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.56,0:14:36.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rob Lucci?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.91,0:14:39.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LILITH laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.00,0:14:41.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess it's time\Nto feed the cat.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.14,0:14:41.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.52,0:14:42.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, and look!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:42.48,0:14:44.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've got five\Ntuna steaks here!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.29,0:14:44.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.83,0:14:46.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's hand these\Ngoofballs over.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.86,0:14:52.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Let me out of these shoes\Nright now, you sick bastards!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.08,0:14:53.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No! Why is he here?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:53.58,0:14:55.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought he quit his job!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.52,0:14:56.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't let him get in!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.46,0:14:59.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He better not even try!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.47,0:15:01.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll send him packin' myself!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:01.49,0:15:02.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Robin.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:02.42,0:15:03.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're safe with us!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.32,0:15:05.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll beat him as many\Ntimes as it takes!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:05.54,0:15:06.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.44,0:15:09.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHAKA] Officially, they're here\Nto return the seraphim.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.11,0:15:09.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.71,0:15:11.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell them to leave it\Nand send them away.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:11.88,0:15:13.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PYTHAGORAS] Excuse me?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.56,0:15:15.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHAKA] We're going to bar\Nthe Government's entry.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.69,0:15:16.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lock down the island!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:16.83,0:15:18.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[STRAW HATS gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:15:16.97,0:15:17.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:18.04,0:15:20.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:15:25.72,0:15:26.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LINDBERGH] Whoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:26.58,0:15:27.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.34,0:15:28.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold up!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.84,0:15:34.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LINDBERGH] Wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.46,0:15:34.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.96,0:15:36.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're still under repair!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:36.43,0:15:38.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't start moving now!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:45.10,0:15:45.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dragon, help!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:46.33,0:15:47.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's something\Nwrong with Kuma!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.85,0:15:48.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:48.81,0:15:49.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kuma.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.97,0:15:51.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[INAZUMA] Stop, Kuma!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.28,0:15:52.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:53.73,0:15:56.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe the Navy is still\Ngiving him orders somehow!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:57.90,0:15:59.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:16:05.03,0:16:06.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do you need?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.09,0:16:07.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let us help you!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:07.23,0:16:10.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can you at least tell us\Nwhere you're trying to go?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:18.61,0:16:19.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[DRAGON] What started this?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.85,0:16:20.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LINDBERGH] I don't know!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.75,0:16:22.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He just got up\Nout of the blue!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.52,0:16:25.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's not supposed\Nto have any free will left.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.29,0:16:27.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOALA] Stop it!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.85,0:16:29.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're gonna hurt yourself!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:30.93,0:16:32.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come back here, Kuma!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:32.36,0:16:33.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.32,0:16:47.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need you, Kuma!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:48.02,0:16:49.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're part of our family!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.79,0:16:52.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have to stick together\Nand see our battle through!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:00.11,0:17:00.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No! Kuma, stop!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:01.07,0:17:02.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please, don't go!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:11.05,0:17:12.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:17.10,0:17:19.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you for returning\Nour seraphim to us.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.00,0:17:25.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, your request for entry is\Ndenied, so just drop him off and go, please.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:25.74,0:17:26.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh, no need to worry!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:27.00,0:17:29.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}S-Bear can return home\Non his own two feet.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:29.76,0:17:31.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And from there,\Nyou'll have to forgive us.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:31.72,0:17:34.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But we are so busy,\Nwe can barely think straight.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:34.92,0:17:38.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So, um, order S-Bear to return\Nand you can call it a day!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.41,0:17:39.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mission complete!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:39.57,0:17:40.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thank you for your service.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.99,0:17:41.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAKU] Whoa there!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.87,0:17:44.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't just leave\Nus out in the cold!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:44.48,0:17:46.17,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUCCI]\NSeems they're on to us.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:46.25,0:17:48.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAKU] Aren't you at least going\Nto invite us in for a cup of tea?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:48.60,0:17:49.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've been sailing for days.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.99,0:17:51.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're freezing out here!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.34,0:17:55.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[PYTHAGORAS] Naval Branch G-14 is\Nright around the corner.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.37,0:17:57.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sure they'll welcome\Nyou with open arms.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:57.46,0:17:59.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Am I speaking to Vegapunk?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:59.26,0:17:59.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[PYTHAGORAS] Uh. Yes?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:59.94,0:18:01.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have a question\Nfor you, Doctor.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.35,0:18:05.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do you know about\Nthe Egghead disappearances?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.73,0:18:06.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PYTHAGORAS] Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:08.22,0:18:09.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Disappearances?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:09.93,0:18:11.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[PYTHAGORAS]\NI beg your pardon?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:11.55,0:18:13.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm afraid I don't follow.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:13.73,0:18:18.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUCCI] Two months ago, Cipher Pol Number\N5's ship vanished into thin air.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.28,0:18:20.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A month ago,\Nit was Cipher Pol Number 7.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:21.07,0:18:23.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Two weeks ago,\NCipher Pol Number 8.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:23.68,0:18:26.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quite the strange coincidence.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:26.10,0:18:30.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In fact, not one Government ship that has\Nvisited Egghead in the past two months has
Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.53,0:18:31.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}returned.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:31.20,0:18:34.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was hoping you might be able\Nto shed some light on why.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:34.29,0:18:35.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:35.31,0:18:36.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.83,0:18:37.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(638.5,1053)}– Huh?\N– [PYTHAGORAS] Hm?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.44,0:18:40.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PYTHAGORAS]\NWell, I am so sorry to hear
Dialogue: 50,0:18:40.11,0:18:43.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that, but rest assured,\Nwe don't have them here.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.21,0:18:46.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My records show that all vessels\Nhave shipped out in ship-shape.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:46.71,0:18:47.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.92,0:18:49.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What exactly are\Nyou implying?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:49.70,0:18:53.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to say we've been messing\Nwith those ships, you overgrown housecat?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:53.92,0:18:54.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go to hell!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:54.87,0:18:57.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PYTHAGORAS] Lilith, I know you're evil,\Nbut please don't antagonize me!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.77,0:18:58.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:58.34,0:19:00.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You are gonna look so\Nstupid when I open this port!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.07,0:19:01.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PYTHAGORAS] Lilith!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.56,0:19:02.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:02.04,0:19:03.20,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}[LILITH] Back off, Pythagoras!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.28,0:19:03.98,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I gotta fight!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.77,0:19:06.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ah, well, like I said, no ships here,\Nbut we appreciate your visit.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:06.39,0:19:07.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Goodbye!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:08.00,0:19:10.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fine then. If you insist.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:10.41,0:19:11.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HATTORI caws]
Dialogue: 50,0:19:12.91,0:19:15.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nice try, but I doubt\Nthey're going to budge.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:15.39,0:19:17.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAKU]\NShall we move on to Plan B?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:18.97,0:19:20.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone, get ready.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:20.47,0:19:22.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're going to abandon ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:23.95,0:19:25.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll use the seraphim.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.23,0:19:26.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,S-Bear follows our orders.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:26.74,0:19:28.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll have it transport\Nus to Egghead.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.94,0:19:32.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're sacrificing the ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:32.80,0:19:36.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As soon as we leave, it will fall\Nprey to the Sea Beast Weapons.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:38.39,0:19:39.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[AGENTS] Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:40.53,0:19:42.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAKU] That's a tad bit risky,\Ndon't you think?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.58,0:19:46.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Impatience isn't attractive\Nin a man, you know.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.32,0:19:49.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you wanna be swallowed by\Nthe sea, you're welcome to stay.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.40,0:19:51.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[STUSSY] And threats, too?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.77,0:19:52.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.02,0:20:10.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you wanna leave\Nthis place, old man?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.91,0:20:11.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But it's your lab.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.70,0:20:13.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought you liked living here.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:13.81,0:20:15.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[VEGAPUNK]\NWhat's not to like?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:15.24,0:20:18.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why, I'm creating\Nthe future itself here!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:18.33,0:20:22.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can use Government facilities\Nand funds however I please.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:22.48,0:20:26.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,268)}And thus, my research has\Ncontinued at an extraordinary pace!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:26.40,0:20:29.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've seen only a small\Nfraction of my work!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.62,0:20:30.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER, LUFFY gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:30.71,0:20:35.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My brain is a fountain of ideas\Nthat never stops flowing!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.55,0:20:37.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But there's not enough time.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:37.20,0:20:38.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nor enough help,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:38.17,0:20:41.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nor enough money to make\Nmy true dream a reality!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:42.70,0:20:45.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You mean you're planning\Nsomething even bigger?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.55,0:20:47.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You want to know what it is?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:47.70,0:20:49.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BOTH] You bet we do!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.36,0:20:53.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When it happens, the whole\Nuniverse will know my name!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.13,0:20:55.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.49,0:20:57.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is it another big robot?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:57.20,0:20:58.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell us, please!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.12,0:21:00.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Very well, then!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:00.30,0:21:01.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's really quite simple.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:01.78,0:21:04.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will use science\Nto squash inequality!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:04.59,0:21:09.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will create a world where\Nfree energy is provided to all!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.08,0:21:13.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's not the reaction\NI expected.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:13.48,0:21:14.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:14.31,0:21:15.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Free stuff's cool, I guess.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:16.03,0:21:18.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That would be a worthwhile\Nendeavor if you could achieve it.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:18.68,0:21:21.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Most wars are\Nfought over energy.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:21.15,0:21:23.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We might be able\Nto achieve world peace,
Dialogue: 50,0:21:23.36,0:21:25.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but resources are too limited.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.17,0:21:26.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are they limited?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.49,0:21:28.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or is it mankind\Nwho is limited?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:30.16,0:21:31.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Energy is everywhere!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.64,0:21:33.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can feel it!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:33.84,0:21:34.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In the air!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:35.11,0:21:36.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In the ground!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:36.31,0:21:37.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's all around us!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:38.46,0:21:40.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's simply overflowing!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:40.75,0:21:43.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The world is full of energy!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:46.17,0:21:50.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[VEGAPUNK] All we need to do is convert\Nit into tangible power!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:50.29,0:21:53.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Inequality will become\Na thing of the past!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:53.22,0:21:55.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wars will come to an end!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:59.01,0:22:02.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With the power of science,\Nwe can make this world a utopia!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:06.39,0:22:08.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[VEGAPUNK]\NStill not interested?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:08.40,0:22:11.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] No, I think it's really cool that\Nyou wanna make people happy.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:12.06,0:22:14.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But hero stuff just\Nisn't my thing.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:14.73,0:22:17.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you never said\Nwhy you wanna leave.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:17.17,0:22:19.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, I have a problem.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:19.19,0:22:23.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The more I try to create this energy,\Nthe further I delve into lost history.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:24.42,0:22:26.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For example, I can't help it.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:26.58,0:22:30.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't help but to look to our giant\Nmechanical friend here and wonder what
Dialogue: 50,0:22:30.04,0:22:32.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,kind of ancient energy\Nsource powered him.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:32.88,0:22:36.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It is the nature of a scientist\Nto remain curious, after all.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:37.15,0:22:42.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So I took a little peek into history\Nand unraveled some forbidden truths.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:43.06,0:22:48.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was only carrying on my friend's will, but it\Ntook me deep into dangerous waters.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:52.76,0:22:53.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:54.40,0:22:55.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:54.56,0:22:55.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:22:59.06,0:23:00.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And that's my story!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:00.27,0:23:01.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just love learning too much!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:01.95,0:23:03.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, the Government\Nwill erase me!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:03.76,0:23:04.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just like...
Dialogue: 50,0:23:06.91,0:23:08.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This can't be good.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:08.11,0:23:09.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It must be CP0.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:10.24,0:23:11.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, 0?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:11.48,0:23:13.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[VEGAPUNK] They're a spy\Norganization directly
Dialogue: 50,0:23:13.61,0:23:16.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,under the orders\Nof the Celestial Dragons.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:16.30,0:23:17.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought they\Nwere called CP9.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:17.99,0:23:19.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did they change\Ntheir name, or what?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:20.00,0:23:21.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,CP0 is a higher rank.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:22.55,0:23:24.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You rarely see\Nthem make a move.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:24.82,0:23:29.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But when they do, it means that\Nthe course of history is about to change.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:29.60,0:23:30.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAKU] Ah!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:30.88,0:23:33.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This place is incredible!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:33.87,0:23:35.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why, I've never\Nseen anything like it!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:35.94,0:23:36.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's unreal!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:36.96,0:23:39.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like we stepped\Nstraight into the future!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:39.59,0:23:41.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm getting a little\Nfired up here!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:42.20,0:23:44.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's Cipher Pol doing here?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:44.11,0:23:46.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And why aren't they\Nwearing their black suits?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:46.30,0:23:47.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How bizarre.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:47.18,0:23:49.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't they usually come\Nin through the port?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:49.99,0:23:50.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:50.90,0:23:51.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:51.39,0:23:55.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We just got a report that two of the Sea\NBeast Weapons were attacked at the shore!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:55.03,0:23:55.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:55.74,0:24:00.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me... does that\Nmean they're intruders?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:04.01,0:24:06.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PYTHAGORAS] Shaka! CP0 is\Non the island!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:08.27,0:24:09.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gah! We're too late!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:09.47,0:24:10.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're here!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:10.90,0:24:12.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lucci's bein' a giant\Npain in the ass.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:12.99,0:24:15.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What else is new?\NCat bastard.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:15.29,0:24:16.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:16.32,0:24:18.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give it up already, Lucci!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:22.77,0:24:24.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Ugh. I'm still stuck!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:24.09,0:24:26.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Would you fix these stupid\Nfuture shoes already?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:27.29,0:24:28.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I need my damn feet!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:28.83,0:24:30.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How else can I\Nkeep Robin safe?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:32.02,0:24:34.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHAKA] How did they come\Nashore so quickly?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:45.57,0:24:47.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PYTHAGORAS]\NWell, definitely not by ship,
Dialogue: 50,0:24:47.65,0:24:49.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's for darn sure.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:49.21,0:24:52.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seems they realized the Sea Beast Weapons\Nwould attack their ship as soon
Dialogue: 50,0:24:52.95,0:24:54.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,as they refused to leave.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:54.33,0:24:57.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They must have used\Nthe seraphim's Paw-Paw power to fly here!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:58.06,0:24:59.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:59.41,0:25:00.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHAKA] How resourceful.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:01.23,0:25:05.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They must really want a fight\Nif they're sacrificing their ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:05.08,0:25:06.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:06.09,0:25:07.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If that's what you desire.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:08.23,0:25:09.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sound the alarm!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:09.41,0:25:11.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need to evacuate\Nthe citizens!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:11.83,0:25:12.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PYTHAGORAS] Roger that!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:14.15,0:25:19.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[alarms blaring]
Dialogue: 50,0:25:24.20,0:25:26.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHAKA]\NTell Atlas to return to the lab!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:24.36,0:25:28.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[alarm blaring]
Dialogue: 50,0:25:27.05,0:25:29.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Prepare all of the seraphim\Nfor combat!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:30.40,0:25:31.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sentomaru will lead them!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:40.87,0:25:43.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHAKA] Releasing seraphim\Nnumber one.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:43.73,0:25:44.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,S-Hawk.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:44.05,0:25:44.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,S-Hawk!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:49.89,0:25:51.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHAKA] Releasing seraphim\Nnumber three.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:52.64,0:25:53.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,S-Snake.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:54.07,0:25:57.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,S-Snake!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:57.87,0:25:59.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHAKA] Releasing seraphim\Nnumber 4.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:00.91,0:26:01.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,S-Shark!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:05.46,0:26:06.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHAKA] Deploy!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:09.38,0:26:11.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[VEGAPUNK] If the World\NGovernment has decided
Dialogue: 50,0:26:11.13,0:26:13.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they want to kill me,\Nthen I don't have much
Dialogue: 50,0:26:13.43,0:26:14.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,time left.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:14.71,0:26:18.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,CP0 is here, so I need\Nto pack my bags.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:18.12,0:26:22.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now please honor my re-quasar\Nand take me out to sea with you!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:23.14,0:26:26.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You make it sound like we're all just\Ngoing on a picnic or something.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:26.37,0:26:28.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you disappear,\Nit'll be big news.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:28.54,0:26:31.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This might put an even\Nbigger target on our backs.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:33.21,0:26:35.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay. Your head looks\Nfunny, so why not?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:35.54,0:26:37.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How is that a reason?!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:38.70,0:26:39.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[laughs] Splendid!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:39.68,0:26:42.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Somehow, I had\Na feeling you'd say yes!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:42.24,0:26:44.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright! Let us go!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:44.26,0:26:46.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This will be a battlefield soon!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:47.05,0:26:50.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For starters, please bring Bonney\Nto the Labophase above the clouds.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:51.02,0:26:52.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHow do we get up there?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:52.66,0:26:53.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It should be easy.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:54.07,0:26:55.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just take the Vacuum Rocket.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:55.80,0:26:58.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can find it down here\Nin the Fabriophase phase.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:58.60,0:27:00.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's a Vacuum Rocket?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:00.20,0:27:01.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That sounds cool!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:02.48,0:27:04.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, don't dawdle now, boys!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:04.14,0:27:07.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See you in the sky\Nin the blink of an eye!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:07.72,0:27:09.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BOTH gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:27:09.12,0:27:10.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER] He disappeared!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:11.23,0:27:12.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] You're awesome,\NMister Apple Man!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:13.67,0:27:16.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[JINBE] I'm finding the future\Nto be very confusing.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:17.52,0:27:19.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAKU]\NHey, take a gander at that!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:20.04,0:27:21.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a giant monster!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:34.80,0:27:35.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:35.65,0:27:36.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It won't die!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:38.04,0:27:40.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The bullets go right through it!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:40.11,0:27:41.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAKU] Of course they do.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:41.39,0:27:45.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This island is full of technical marvels\Nbeyond your wildest imagination!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:45.20,0:27:48.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you think your guns will work\Nhere, then you've been had!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:49.24,0:27:51.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've always wanted to fight\Nsomething like you.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:51.82,0:27:53.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Something untouchable.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:54.49,0:27:56.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I know why they\Ncouldn't hurt you.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:56.87,0:27:59.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because you're\Nfrom outer space!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:59.22,0:28:04.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAKU]\NPrepare yourself, alien fiend!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:12.20,0:28:13.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[KAKU] Tempest!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:13.25,0:28:14.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[KAKU] What?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:18.42,0:28:20.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:28:20.67,0:28:23.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAKU] It must have some sort\Nof space physiology!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:23.47,0:28:24.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:24.64,0:28:26.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAKU] I'm not giving up!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:26.13,0:28:26.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[STUSSY] Well, you should.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:27.03,0:28:27.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a hologram.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:28.05,0:28:29.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAKU] Why didn't you\Ntell me sooner?!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:30.04,0:28:32.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have you, perhaps,\Nbeen here before?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:32.44,0:28:34.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's say it's nostalgic.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:35.67,0:28:37.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAKU]\NWell, I'm already up here.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:37.44,0:28:41.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I might as well check out whatever\Nthis thing is above the clouds.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:41.10,0:28:43.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chances are, that's where\NVegapunk is hiding!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:44.24,0:28:47.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Lucci, do you see those\Nyellow lines way up there?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:47.15,0:28:48.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In the clouds?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:48.08,0:28:49.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah. Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:51.85,0:28:54.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Watch what happens when\Nsomeone crosses them.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:56.46,0:28:58.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[beep]
Dialogue: 50,0:28:58.58,0:29:00.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAKU screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:29:02.17,0:29:04.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Laser beams automatically\Nfire on them.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:09.11,0:29:11.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a defensive system\Ncalled the Frontier Dome.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:11.80,0:29:15.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It encircles the Labophase,\Nguarding in all directions.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:17.02,0:29:18.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[AGENTS yell]
Dialogue: 50,0:29:18.72,0:29:22.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The lesson here is not to underestimate\Nthe world's greatest scientist.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:23.00,0:29:24.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You really should've\Ntold him that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.06,0:29:26.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAKU] Stussy!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:26.30,0:29:29.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How could you just stand\Nthere and watch me fry?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:29.28,0:29:30.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[STUSSY giggles]
Dialogue: 50,0:29:30.56,0:29:32.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Warms you up\Nfaster than tea!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:41.07,0:29:44.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think you\Ncan come into my lab?!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:44.67,0:29:45.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And be more violent?!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:49.23,0:29:50.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Punk-ass pigs!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:53.85,0:29:55.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ultra...!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:53.96,0:29:56.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ATLAS yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:29:56.63,0:29:59.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAKU] Alright, this place\Nis officially insane.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:59.31,0:30:01.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that one a hologram, too?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:01.56,0:30:02.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:02.50,0:30:03.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This young lady is Atlas.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:04.45,0:30:06.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's one of the Vegapunks.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:06.16,0:30:06.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:08.05,0:30:08.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Atlas!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:09.30,0:30:09.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Atlas!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:09.61,0:30:11.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Abort mission immediately!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:11.29,0:30:12.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Mighty!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:13.25,0:30:14.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Very well then.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:14.52,0:30:15.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:22.91,0:30:24.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Six-king pistol!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:31.20,0:30:32.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:32.08,0:30:32.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Atlas!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:32.81,0:30:34.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's down!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:34.15,0:30:36.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Merciless as ever, isn't he?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:49.96,0:30:50.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[EGGHEAD CITIZENS gasping]
Dialogue: 50,0:30:50.96,0:30:52.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He beat her in one shot!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:52.26,0:30:53.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This guy's seriously scary!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:53.98,0:30:54.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:54.91,0:30:56.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why is Cipher Pol\Nattacking us?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:56.84,0:31:00.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We both work for the Government,\Nso we're allies, aren't we?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:00.41,0:31:02.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[SHAKA]\NAttention, Fabriophase!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:02.11,0:31:04.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Evacuate the lab immediately!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:09.31,0:31:10.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evacuate now!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:10.13,0:31:10.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[EGGHEAD CITIZEN G]\NAn evacuation notice?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:10.99,0:31:11.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have to go!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:12.05,0:31:13.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run to the factory!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:14.34,0:31:15.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Evacuate now!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:15.10,0:31:16.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[SHAKA] We are under attack!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:19.60,0:31:21.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's still alive, but barely.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:21.74,0:31:24.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's eliminate her while\Nwe have the opportunity.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:24.78,0:31:26.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:31:27.51,0:31:31.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First we gotta find it,\Nthen we fly!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:43.15,0:31:44.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw hat.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:45.18,0:31:45.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[grunting]
Dialogue: 50,0:31:47.42,0:31:48.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pigeon guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.11,0:01:35.49,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\b600\fnFOT-Seurat ProN DB Strp\fscx90\fscy90\blur0.7\bord4.5\pos(1576,725)\c&H000101&\3c&HF2F6F1&\fad(939,0)\1a&HFF&\t(898,938,\1a&H00&)}Scrap Heap\NFabriophase\NEgghead
